Comment: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:02.84,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:04.47,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:10.25,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思議了...
Comment: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:13.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.32,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人無法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狹窄的道路上  我們巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:25.23,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立馬就被你那黑洞一樣的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和誇張
Comment: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:29.30,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}爲何會讓我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:01:31.94,0:01:34.90,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能會下雨
Comment: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.16,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午飯吧
Comment: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:41.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在陽光下盡情享受著日光浴
Comment: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:44.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}這小可愛到底是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:48.44,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}從今往後  我都是屬於你的了
Comment: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:51.52,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}過度的深愛  讓時空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:55.42,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不覺間  你已經成爲了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:56.41,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:57.82,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}讓我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:01:57.82,0:02:00.99,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}説是命運也好  奇迹也罷
Comment: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:04.06,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我們的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:07.99,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中懸吊的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:02:07.99,0:02:11.07,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}純然的愛不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.99,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身邊...
